{"parse": {"title": "三重赋格-04", "pageid": 110908, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%B8%89%E9%87%8D%E8%B5%8B%E6%A0%BC-03\" title=\"三重赋格-03\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">三重赋格-04</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%B8%89%E9%87%8D%E8%B5%8B%E6%A0%BC-05\" title=\"三重赋格-05\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">三重赋格</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">04</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E5.BF.8D.E8.80.90.EF.BC.8C.E5.BF.8D.E8.80.90\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"忍耐，忍耐\">忍耐，忍耐</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 忍耐，忍耐</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Endurance</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"linzhongxiuqichu_ye\"><img alt=\"linzhongxiuqichu_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_ye.png/600px-Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_ye.png/900px-Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_ye.png/1200px-Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>夜晚的工作已经告一段落，推车上的木板在一次下坡中破损了些许。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>……得找一块完整的木板。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他想起帕蒂塔就在那一方帐篷中小憩，于是他放缓脚步，依着夜色寻找木板。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这里不是与敌人僵持不下、以性命惨烈拉锯的战壕。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>应该不会有士兵来这里，寂静只是寂静。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一声隐隐的抽噎穿过了沉睡的树林，如同小虫嗡鸣般在卡戎耳边响起。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一声，两声，抽噎声由断续连成了一条长线。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>……帕蒂塔。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他长久地驻足在潮湿的夜色里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>“永远只在无人的寂静里哭。”</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-luyingdi_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"luyingdi_ye\"><img alt=\"luyingdi_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/Cg-luyingdi_ye.png/600px-Cg-luyingdi_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/Cg-luyingdi_ye.png/900px-Cg-luyingdi_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/Cg-luyingdi_ye.png/1200px-Cg-luyingdi_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他放下木板，提着马灯缓步向前，在帐篷前坐了下来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她嚎啕大哭，如小兽哀啼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>笔记本里的字句又在这压抑的动与静中出现，卡戎索性翻开了它。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-typerbg.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"typerbg\"><img alt=\"typerbg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/Cg-typerbg.png/600px-Cg-typerbg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/Cg-typerbg.png/900px-Cg-typerbg.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/Cg-typerbg.png/1200px-Cg-typerbg.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-527902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-527902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-527902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>法比安……曾经的他照顾着我们所有人。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-luyingdi_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"luyingdi_ye\"><img alt=\"luyingdi_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/Cg-luyingdi_ye.png/600px-Cg-luyingdi_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/Cg-luyingdi_ye.png/900px-Cg-luyingdi_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/Cg-luyingdi_ye.png/1200px-Cg-luyingdi_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>笔记本被翻到下一页，是那张被卡戎捡起的相片。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>帕蒂塔哀恸的声音流淌过黑与白，相片里，女性依然在微笑着看向卡戎。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>这又是属于谁的另一个世界？</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_0_bg_zhanhao1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_0_bg_zhanhao1\"><img alt=\"3_0_bg_zhanhao1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/Cg-3_0_bg_zhanhao1.png/600px-Cg-3_0_bg_zhanhao1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/Cg-3_0_bg_zhanhao1.png/900px-Cg-3_0_bg_zhanhao1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/Cg-3_0_bg_zhanhao1.png/1200px-Cg-3_0_bg_zhanhao1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾伯哈特：</div><div>有阵子没见了，保罗。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>只是四天，但你是我们的连长，四天确实不短。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>艾伯哈特笑了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾伯哈特：</div><div>四天足够你遇到帕蒂塔这个难题，弗兰兹都和我说了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>的确是难题，但也不能完全算难题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾伯哈特：</div><div>她要找瓦尔特死亡的真相，这也算一种歪打正着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾伯哈特：</div><div>难道说她是魔女？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>应该不是，只是巧合。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>随口的玩笑得到了一板一眼的回答。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾伯哈特：</div><div>如果士兵们知道这个真相，或许会狠狠打一架，再背个处分……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾伯哈特：</div><div>最坏的情况下，他们会去偷袭，去杀人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾伯哈特：</div><div>但帕蒂塔毕竟不是士兵，她没有将野蛮学得这么透彻。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>她在忍耐一切，关于战争的一切。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>艾伯哈特沉默着，他在等待卡戎的下一句话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>士兵也是在竭尽全力地忍耐。野蛮是生存的本能，但野蛮也是发泄的途径。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>她可以在野战医院奔波救人，见惯痛苦和死亡。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>也可以夜宿在交战区域附近的树林，即使根本无法安眠。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>忍耐恐惧，忍耐痛苦，忍耐愤怒，忍耐战争，忍耐死亡。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>她和士兵无异。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>艾伯哈特的面部肌肉绷紧了，他挪开了视线。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾伯哈特：</div><div>非常糟糕吗？帕蒂塔的情况。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>我不知道这算不算糟糕，总之不是健康的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾伯哈特：</div><div>那我恐怕还有些更糟糕的消息。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾伯哈特：</div><div>她申领了一把手枪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾伯哈特：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>你批准了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾伯哈特：</div><div>跟我没关系，沃尔克中校批准的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾伯哈特：</div><div>跟着卡戎埋葬士兵的战地护士想要一把手枪防身，没有不批准的理由吧？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾伯哈特：</div><div>就算不批准，在前线找一把武器也不是什么难事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾伯哈特：</div><div>让她冒险外出，再搜罗到一把会炸膛的枪……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>那还是直接配发的好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾伯哈特：</div><div>我也这么认为。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>但是她应该不会用枪，手枪的使用也需要训练。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>就算有一把武器拿在手里，也不是每个人都有扣动扳机的能力。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾伯哈特：</div><div>这就是另一个糟糕的消息了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>……什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾伯哈特：</div><div>来之前她参加了新兵训练，而且我听说她在射击上非常有天赋。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾伯哈特：</div><div>这就是为什么她的申领可以被这么快批准下来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>……她有备而来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾伯哈特：</div><div>她有备而来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾伯哈特：</div><div>野战医院两天后撤离，在护士轮换之前，你还有时间劝她回家。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>能劝她改变主意的人都已经死了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他们的衣角被风推动，扬起又落下，循环往复，仿佛沉重又缓慢的呼吸。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾伯哈特：</div><div>……我知道。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>死在战争中，死在我们的记忆里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>死在燃起又消逝的火星之间，死在尘土的每一扬每一落。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾伯哈特：</div><div>你们三个人的关系真的很好——曾经，你没那么外向，帕蒂塔则有些急躁。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾伯哈特：</div><div>瓦尔特是你们三人圈子的中心，他同时兼容着你们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾伯哈特：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾伯哈特：</div><div>无论如何，你是现在唯一能够劝她的人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾伯哈特：</div><div>因为你是保罗。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>这很难。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾伯哈特：</div><div>唉，你总不能指望我去劝她，我初中跟她话不投机还挨了她一拳，啧，历历在目。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾伯哈特：</div><div>倒是那张相片，抱着矢车菊的女性？弗兰兹这几天到处打听。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>是的，我在找那张相片的主人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾伯哈特：</div><div>我更擅长替你去找那张相片的主人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>好，谢谢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾伯哈特：</div><div>还有什么需要我帮忙的吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>没有要帮忙的，但我在野战医院遇到了法比安，他挣扎在生死线上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾伯哈特：</div><div>我没听过他……旧友？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>是的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾伯哈特：</div><div>多陪陪他吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>艾伯哈特瞥见卡戎微微起伏的衣料，他似乎是点了点头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>我会的。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "三重赋格-04"}}